    "metrics": {
      "chapter": "Chapter V · The Proof",
      "headline": "Visible momentum. Receipts, not vibes.",
      "lead": "Aetheria's stat engine watches the small stuff so you don't have to: focus minutes, streak depth, quest velocity, recovery time. It's a permanent record of <em>becoming</em>, plotted with the satisfying motion of a great game.",
